000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          SRESERVE.
000400 AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        4/29/88.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.
001000*D   ADD, MODIFY, OR DELETE RESERVATIONS SUBPROGRAM: EITHER
001100*D   WORKORDER RESERVATIONS OR STOREROOM WORKSHEET RESERVATIONS.

      *C   06/10/96   JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   PARM R-DATE IN CALL TO CRESERVE WAS INCREASED TO
      *C   INCLUDE CENTURY.  FIGURE CENTURY BEFORE CALLING PROGRAM.
001200
001300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001400 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001500 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
001600 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MSTORERM-CD-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZUDCSTR-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

001800 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MSTORERM-CD-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MSTORERM-CD-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0200  OF MCFLCS0201.

       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC        PIC X(1500).

001900 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002000
002100 77  MOD-DEL-FLAG                  PIC X(1).
002200 77  SAVE-QTY                      PIC S9(8)  VALUE ZERO.
002300
