004600
004700**  SEE LINKAGE SECTION FOR VIEW-COMAREA
004800
004900 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
005000     05  MSG-TEXT.
               10  MESSAGE-BUFFER-1        PIC X(1).
               10  FILLER                  PIC X(67).
005100     05  MSG-FLD                     PIC X(8)   VALUE SPACES.
005200     05  MSG-FLD-9 REDEFINES MSG-FLD PIC ZZZZZZZ9.
005300
